  "description": "Hae-Young is smart, independent, a minor celebrity, and a virgin. It’s not like she hasn’t been trying—she just hasn’t found the right guy. She’s dated plenty of guys, even rising stars, but none of them have quite stacked up. After an awkward night of drinking, she discovers that her childhood friend is packing everything she wants and more. Will her bid to lose her v-card to her friend destroy their relationship, or will it lead to something more?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
